fixture zone1_loop
doc The 60-second loop through zone 1 that stands for the Immaculate Checklist's "movement-only loop" (it is the same route, not a stripped one: it strikes, with 48 attack presses that are the pogo down-strikes and dash-slashes the rooms teach, and it carries the Kindle Votive; it takes no hit): from room 01's west arrival with the Kindle Votive (option kindle 1), through all twelve rooms by their teaching routes (each room's route fixture, started on the tick after the previous room's door is crossed, so Ash arrives with the speed she left with) and out of room 12's east door back into room 01. 3461 ticks (57.7 s); per room: 359, 242, 221, 552, 412, 487, 161, 211, 214, 179, 247, 176. No hit is taken and no heart lost. Room 3 is the 4-a-second chain of 10 bounces over the 3008 u pit (zone1_03_pogo_chain_route; the carried speed puts Ash at the door a tick sooner, so 221 ticks, not 222). Room 4 opens with one tick of left, to give back the 13 u that the carried speed adds, and room 7 with 2 and room 11 with 1 (see docs/feel_log/2026-10-19-merge-zone1.md). Longer than the 600-frame guideline by design.
room zone1/01_dash_slash
spawn 74 832
option kindle 1
frames 3461
